    "description": "Title\n: Lot Of 5 Pcs Cross 6601 Ball Pen Pencil Set 12Kt Gold Filled Stationery Opened\nOptional title\n: Cross 12KT Gold Filled Ball Pen Pencil Sets Lot Unused\nBrand\n: Cross\nModel\n: 6601\nColor\n: Gold\nMaterial\n: 12 KT gold filled\nCategory\n: Collectibles & Art\nDepartment\n: Collectibles > Post Cards/Photographs/Stationery\nType\n: Cross Ball Pen Pencil Set 12 Kt. Gold Filled 6601 Lot In Opened Boxes\nCondition\n: Good - shows some sign of wear\nApproximate measurements (inches)\n: 7L x 3W x 5H\nWeight (approximate)\n: 1.2 lbs\nDescription\n: Elevate your writing experience with this luxurious lot of Cross 12KT Gold Filled Ball Pen and Pencil Sets, model 6601. Each set, presented in its original box, exudes timeless sophistication with its classic gold finish and exceptional build quality. Renowned for their precision and durability, Cross writing instruments are a staple for collectors and professionals alike.\nThe lot includes five elegantly boxed sets, each featuring a matching ballpoint pen and mechanical pencil. The shimmering 12KT gold filled exterior offers both aesthetic appeal and long-lasting shine, while the slim, balanced design ensures comfortable writing for extended periods. Perfect for gifting, executive use, or adding to a distinguished collection, these sets blend functional excellence with iconic Cross craftsmanship.\nAuthenticity is assured by the original Cross branding and packaging. These sets are in unused, opened-box condition, ready to impress. Invest in classic style and reliable performance with Crosswhere tradition meets quality.\nCross Ball Pen Pencil Set 12 Kt. Gold Filled 6601 Lot In Opened Boxes",
