    "description": "Natural Formation\nPink Lace Agate and Quartz Geode\nPolished Natural Stone Specimen\n5\" x 5\" x 5\"\nUnsigned\nThis natural geode specimen features a professionally polished face revealing a complex interior of translucent quartz crystals and delicate pink agate banding. The intricate lace-like patterns showcase shades of mauve, blush, and cream, framed by a rugged, unrefined stone matrix. The specimen is cut with a flat base, allowing it to stand independently as a striking decorative accent or centerpiece, capturing light through its dense crystalline structures.\nSubstantial weight of 2.29 lbs provides significant presence and stability for display\nHigh-gloss polished surface highlights the natural geometric crystalline formations\nFlat-cut base allows for upright standing on shelves, mantels, or desks\nCondition:\nExcellent condition with a high-gloss polished face free of deep scratches. The outer matrix remains in its natural state with characteristic textures and minor natural imperfections inherent to geodes.\nThis is a pre-owned item donated to Goodwill of Northern Michigan.\nPlease see images for further detail and ask any questions you may have before making a bid.\nItems have been tested for power, not function. In some instances we may not have the necessary equipment to test certain electronics therefore all items will be auctioned off AS-IS with no refunds.\nItems in lots are sold as-is, are not eligible for refunds, and may not be individually wrapped.\nPlease contact us before making payment to review combined shipping options.\nPick-Ups\nWe're open Monday - Friday, 8 am - 4 pm. We are closed on weekends and major holidays. For local pickup in Traverse City, please give us 24 hours from time of payment to prepare your order. Thank you!",
